# Publish site changes

This site is served from the `main` branch by GitHub Pages: https://harper42.github.io/equal-shared-parenting-map/

When the user asks for a change to the site, commit it and push `main` in the same turn. Do not stop after editing the files, and do not wait for a separate request to publish, push, or go live.

A push to `main` starts the Pages workflow. Leave that run alone. Do not request a second Pages build while one is already queued or running, because GitHub cancels the first.

Still do not commit or push work the user did not ask for, secrets, or an empty commit.
